	(text "CAPTURE PLAN\n\nPAC1954T-E/4MX and four Kelvin shunts\nFour TPS2553DRVR current-limited branches\nTCA9539PWR enables and FAULT_N inputs\nSN74LVC08APWR gates every branch with CAM_PWR_EN\nPer-branch effective bulk >= 22 uF plus local 100 nF\nCAM1_5V through CAM4_5V rail test points\n\nINITIAL LIMIT: about 1 A; final resistor from measured inrush/capture current."
